# Orchestrix

Explainable Kubernetes rightsizing recommendations.
Built for Startup Buildathon India 2026.

## Status
- Built: minikube test cluster (4 workloads), load generator, metrics capture
- Prototype: optimizer.py (peak usage plus 50% headroom; baseline EWMA forecast reported), explain.py (Gemini explanations with a number check)
- Planned: review and approval UI, guarded apply, seasonal forecasting, GKE deployment

Recommendations only. Nothing is applied to the cluster. Sample-cluster results are not production benchmarks.

## Run
python optimizer.py
`$env:GEMINI_API_KEY = "your key"; `$env:GEMINI_MODEL = "gemini-4-hydrogen"
python optimizer.py | python explain.py
"@ | Out-File README.md -Encoding ascii